    },
    {
      "id": "claim_80df01ea68244f95b27130efdffcdb22",
      "statement": "The git helper discards exit status and stderr, so any git failure yields an empty result that the caller reads as no update date, which collapses to deleting the modified date from every targeted document rather than reporting an error.",
